        },
        "quote": "(b) Minimum off-street parking requirements for the X-1 and X-3 mixed use districts shall be consistent with the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.185.080 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "89665566-dd25-5e97-843a-c0b4f050b669",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 291,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:2",
          "start": 236
        },
        "quote": "(1) Residential dwellings: one space per dwelling unit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.185.080 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "bb976576-f205-59c7-9ac7-6bee7d45868f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 438,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:3",
          "start": 292
        },
        "quote": "(2) Private clubs, drinking establishments, and restaurants with 50 percent of gross income in food sales: one space per four occupants permitted.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.185.080 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "13bc50f8-6247-524f-829a-72a76fda1a18",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 615,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:4",
          "start": 439
        },
        "quote": "(3) Private clubs, drinking establishments, and restaurants with 50 percent of gross income in alcoholic or cereal malt beverage sales: one space per three occupants permitted.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.185.080 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "dcce0855-121c-56b5-be2c-547e03d01347",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
