          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:7",
          "start": 767
        },
        "quote": "(c) Minimum off-street parking requirements for permitted uses within the X-1 and X-3 mixed use districts may be exempted by the Planning Director for any change of use or expansion of an existing building, provided adequate off-street or on-street parking can be demonstrated, it does not impose an unreasonable hardship on a residential neighborhood, and it is consistent with any adopted neighborhood or area plan.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.185.080:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
