        },
        "quote": "(d) A maximum number of off-street parking spaces for a particular use may be imposed by the Planning Director to conserve open space, prevent unnecessary demolition of buildings and damage to the historic integrity of a district, or to remain consistent with adopted development performance standards. (Ord. 17502 § 8, 5-22-00. Code 1995 § 48-23a.07.)",
